   {
    "t": "p",
    "box": [
     698,
     226,
     407,
     176
    ],
    "text": "Nestled in Ulupuni, Wagamon, The Mountain Table is a tale of transformation and natural splendour. What once was a chaotic landscape of bushes and shrubs evolved into a serene tea plantation, crafted through years of dedication. Our journey began with a humble hut at the plantation's peak, offering mesmerizing sunset vistas that inspired us to share this beauty with the world.",
    "font": "italic 400 18px/25.2px brandon-grot-w01-light, sans-serif ls:normal tt:none ta:start",
    "color": "rgb(91, 90, 90)"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "box": [
     698,
     402,
     407,
     176
    ],
    "text": "Driven by a vision of eco-friendly hospitality, The Mountain Table emerged as a haven where nature's harmony thrives. Our accommodations blend modern comfort with rustic charm, inviting guests to wake up to birdsong and panoramic views. Culinary delights await, crafted from local ingredients by our skilled chefs, while our infinity pool overlooks Idukki Dam and lush hills.",
    "font": "italic 400 18px/25.2px brandon-grot-w01-light, sans-serif ls:normal tt:none ta:start",
    "color": "rgb(91, 90, 90)"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "box": [
     698,
     579,
     407,
     126
    ],
    "text": "Explore tea plantations, and savor grilled dishes at our forest-set grill house. Whether for romance, family, or business, The Mountain Table ensures an unforgettable stay amid nature's enchantment. Step into our story and discover timeless memories in every moment.",
    "font": "italic 400 18px/25.2px brandon-grot-w01-light, sans-serif ls:normal tt:none ta:start",
